# Google Gemini API key for GCC discovery (free tier via Google AI Studio).
# Get one at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Local dev: copy this file to ".env" and paste your key below (".env" is gitignored).
# Production: set GEMINI_API_KEY in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# SerpAPI key for Google Jobs discovery (free tier ~250 searches/month).
# Indexes LinkedIn / Wellfound / Indeed / Naukri postings — fresh Indian jobs,
# incl. smaller startups without a scrapable board. Get one at serpapi.com →
# Dashboard → Your Private API Key. Set SERPAPI_KEY in Vercel.
SERPAPI_KEY=

# Hunter.io API key for recruiter-contact enrichment (free tier).
# Get one at https://hunter.io → Dashboard → API. Set HUNTER_API_KEY in Vercel.
HUNTER_API_KEY=

# Groq API key for LLM discovery (free tier, fast; preferred over Gemini when set).
# Get one at https://console.groq.com → API Keys. Set GROQ_API_KEY in Vercel.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Shared team store (optional) — Vercel KV / Upstash Redis.
# In Vercel: Storage → create a KV (Upstash) store and connect it to this
# project; it auto-sets KV_REST_API_URL and KV_REST_API_TOKEN. Or set the
# Upstash equivalents below. Without these, state stays per-browser.
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
